Fan Rudinn was added in the Deltarune Opening Season of '''Beta 30.0''' as a 2G 1/1 monster that could give +1/+1 to an ally monster of your choice when played. Like the other Rudinns, it also had Ranged. '''Beta 42.1''' removed its Ranged, gave it +1 in all stats and changed its Magic to giving any monster of your choice +1/+2.

